{"id":"wb-5-207","name":"天津广东会馆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天津广东会馆","text":"天津广东会馆始建于清光绪三十三年正月十四日（1907年），坐落于天津城鼓楼南面（今南开区鼓楼街道南门里大街31号），是天津现有保存最大最完整的清代会馆建筑。目前，天津广东会馆被中华人民共和国国务院批准为全国重点文物保护单位，被天津市人民政府批准为天津市文物保护单位和特殊保护等级历史风貌建筑。现为天津市戏剧博物馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E6%B4%A5%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86","revisionId":95323870,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95323870","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4c73daebac1ca31c19b47fd7.jpg","title":"广东会馆.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/%E5%B9%BF%E4%B8%9C%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xrdtj","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​广东会馆外景","width":320,"height":240}}